> So what can I do other then camp on half of DL4?

Proceed in the main dungeon.  Get speed, telepathy and a light 
source, and a wand of digging.  Go down, locate the mind flayer/ 
whatever with telepathy, proceed towards him.  Try to put him to 
sleep[1], then fire some salves of daggers into him.  Wash, rinse 
and repeat, but never ever let this guy come to a square adjacent 
to yours.  For this emergency (you're cornered) use the wand of 
digging to escape downwards; then come up again and continue the 
target practice.  Carefully watch how the movement ratio between 
you and the mf is; usually you should be way faster than him.  
Speed is not absolutely necessary for this, but very helpful.  
You can also try force bolt; IIRC, he has some resistance, however.  
Daggers usually work nicely.  

